==Battleground==
*1 [[Gabriel]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*2 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 36.67~43.33 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The Angelic Gories at at a low magnification, so you can keep using this as Labyrinth fodder. If you're actually struggling, you could try running like one meatshield here, but that's probably unneeded seeing as there's only one Angelic Gory present in this level.

